<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Charge Staff</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Spell Tier: 2
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 17)
Mana: 60
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast charge staff &lt;staff&gt;
</pre>
<p>Restores spent charges to a magic staff you carry, up to as many as the 
staff can hold. The better your spell, the more charges come back: one 
for a modest success, up to four or more for a master.
</p><p>It is risky. If the spell fails, the staff only sputters and goes dim; but 
if it fails badly, the staff explodes in a sphere of uncontrolled mana, 
and is lost: a lightning bolt strikes everyone in the room, you included. 
Charge staffs where no friend stands close. You must be standing, and no 
free hands are needed. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
